  abilityDesc: 12 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes, probable KO resistance
    negation for 2 turns (PvP modes only), hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec and enormously
    boosts critical hit rate for 3 turns, probable huge 2 turn Atk, Def reduction
    & reduces foes' BB gauge
